  "prefLabel": "Pes 403.02 Certification of Crew Members",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pes 403.02 Certification of Crew Members. At least one member of each crew shall be registered at either the operational or supervisory level and be present whenever and wherever a commercial application of pesticides is made in this state.\n\nSource. #150, eff 1-9-74; ss by #2209, eff 12-13-82; ss by #2781, eff 7-26-84; ss by #4867, eff 7-19-90; ss by #6258, eff 5-30-96; ss by #8059, eff 5-30-04; ss by #10198-B, eff 10-3-12; ss by #13363, eff 6-1-22, EXPIRES: 6-1-32",
